During setTimeout, screen could change? fine.

`resolveChoice`:
```js
const node=EVENT_MAP[state.nodeId];
const choice=node.choices[index];
const beforeClock=fmtClock(...);
const fx=resolve(choice.fx||{},ctx);
const deltas=applyEffects(fx);
// counters are inside applyEffects
