Wait auto trigger should be queued after current trigger; use `queue.push`.
- Apply auto only if queue length < 2.
- Determine `currentTriggered = !!pending`.
- `state.visitCount[nextId] = ...`.
- `state.log.push({time: beforeClock, day: state.day, title: node.title, choice: label, result: resultText, next: nextId})`.
